cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or data, please cite it as below."
title: "TPMS lattice ML: data and code for machine-learning-enabled structure-property mapping of TPMS lattice structures"
type: software
version: "1.0.1"
license: MIT
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.23655240
repository-code: "https://github.com/aliakbermollick/tpms-lattice-ml"
url: "https://aliakbermollick.github.io/tpms-lattice-ml/docs/"
abstract: >-
  Finite-element dataset of 270 triply periodic minimal surface (TPMS) lattices (five families), machine-learning
  surrogate models (Young's modulus and specific stiffness), inverse design, SHAP analysis, Bayesian optimization
  scripts, and a browser calculator.
keywords:
  - TPMS lattice
  - machine learning
  - inverse design
  - SHAP
  - Bayesian optimization
  - additive manufacturing
